Subject: [PATCH 2/6] feat(multimodal): add read_audio with silence-aware
 timestamped transcripts

Segments are cut at detected pauses, wrapped in canonical 16 kHz PCM16 WAV
headers, and sent through ctx.speechToText; the whole-file transcript is
cached by content so windows and later reads cost no recognition.

